// Title: HackTool - KrbRelayUp Execution
// Rule ID: 12827a56-61a4-476a-a9cb-f3068f191073
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.credential-access, attack.t1558.003, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1550.003
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
